{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic尚未正式發佈的下一代旗艦模型Claude Fable 5.5近日在海外開發者社區引發關注。多名開發者在社交平台X上分享了據稱來自該模型的早期測試結果。其中，一段完全通過編程生成的66秒動畫短片尤為引人注目。測試者稱，模型在沒有調用圖像或視頻生成工具的情況下，連續自主編寫和運行代碼約2小時40分鐘，完成了動畫畫面、配樂及音效製作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584962.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:05:46.835239+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T06:52:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.742884+00:00","content_hash":"f9a4bfcaba39e8d9e9cfacaac045f179815b98aa507b50daa1ce711f59927994","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}